#[m
# THE POINT (from full-review.md): the agent's console must be owned by THIS machine, not by an[m
# ssh pipe from the VPS. muxd owns a ConPTY per session; claude/codex live in it. Wi-Fi drops,[m
# VPS reboots, relay deploys — the agent never notices; viewers just reattach. muxd dials OUT[m
# to the VPS relay (no inbound port on the PC) and multiplexes all sessions over one WebSocket.[m
#[m
# Protocol (JSON text frames over ws):[m
#   muxd -> relay:  hello{host,sessions} . sessions{list} . o{s,d:b64} . sb{s,d:b64} . killed{s} . pong[m
#   relay -> muxd:  create{s,rid,cols,rows,relaunch,heal} . i{s,d:b64} . resize{s,cols,rows} .[m
#                    kill{s} . rename{s,to} . heal{s,on} . tail{s,rid,lines} . sb{s} . ping[m
#[m
# State: sessions.json manifest (resume commands) -> muxd restart / PC reboot lists unarmed sessions[m
# as dormant placeholders. Only sessions explicitly armed with heal auto-start.[m
